"P1958626948" "Penelope Yin says we must stay strong. We can defeat {HeroName}."
// Script Variable AWAKENED_INACTIVE :
"P4192722281" "She can see what we see. We're not alone in this."
// Script Variable AWAKENED_INACTIVE :
"P3281218245" "We have to find Subjugator 5. Penelope Yin's whispers tell us to."
// Script Variable AWAKENED_ACTIVE :
"P1736001636" "You won't stop us, {HeroName}! Penelope Yin's will shall keep us going!"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_ACTIVE :
"P4221419450" "This is Penelope Yin, {HeroName}. You will NOT get away with what you've done!"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_ACTIVE :
"P1899949039" "I want you to know, {HeroName}, that I, Penelope Yin, am talking through the Awakened. We are one!"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_INACTIVE_M3 :
"P243194188" "I can feel {HeroName} is here. What does {Hero.gender=male he|she} think {Hero.gender=male he|she} can do?"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_INACTIVE_M3 :
"P124921645" "There's too much chaos here in Primal Earth... how am I ever going to put an end to it?"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_INACTIVE_M3 :
"P856364347" ""
// Script Variable AWAKENED_INACTIVE_M3 :
"P2117946604" "I can do this, I can show father that we can win!"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_ACTIVE_M3 :
"P1746147509" "I see you, {HeroName}. You won't win!"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_ACTIVE_M3 :
"P4212805599" "You're making a big mistake, {HeroName}. I've seen plenty worse than you."
// Script Variable AWAKENED_ACTIVE_M3 :
"P1429081238" "The Awakened will be a force for good, not for your own twisted uses!"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_ACTIVE_M3 :
"P3130917287" "Stay away, {HeroName}! I'm warning you!"
// Script Variable AWAKENED_ACTIVE_M3 :
"P2218834725" "You're going to leave me no choice!"
// Script Variable PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1514658187" "Get a scan on this Penelope Mayhem, now! We have to lock her down!"
// Script Variable PPD_INACTIVE :
"P548435663" "Praetorians... they're making our job that much harder..."
// Script Variable PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1619665707" "Make sure she doesn't find any of the refugees! Keep this Penelope Mayhem down!"
// Script Variable PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3891850823" "Penelope Mayhem keeps mentioning {HeroName}... What does {Hero.gender=male he|she} have to do with this?"
// Script Variable PPD_INACTIVE :
"P2700553563" "Make sure Penelope Yin isn't taken down, we're not sure what would happen if the Penelope Mayhem gets ahold of her!"
// Script Variable PPD_ACTIVE :
"P2992094630" "{HeroName}! How did you get here?"
// Script Variable PPD_ACTIVE :
"P3211062088" "We've got enough problems without you here, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable PPD_ACTIVE :
"P506333317" "Focus your efforts on taking out {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable PPD_ACTIVE :
"P2201691499" "Great, just what we needed, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable PPD_ACTIVE :
"P1654942256" "Penelope Mayhem can't stop talking about you, {HeroName}. We'll find out why!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PsimonHelp 
