// Dialog :
"P1195604998" "Transmuter and Subjugator 5 are looking over the Awakened you captured. Subjugator 5 is doing her best to keep the Awakened locked down, or else Penelope Yin will discover our location.<br><br>In the meantime, Splice's research has paid off. She has found something that we could use to empower Subjugator 5."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P588894253" "Some time ago, Arachnos had a large machine that was called the <color yellow>Jade Tarantula</color>. The design was quite interesting; the machine was powered by the psychic energies of an individual psychic. Recluse planned on having the former Sister Psyche utilize it, but those plans fell through.<br><br>Of course, Recluse would not just simply abandon that project. Splice has located a base where Arachnos is trying to manufacture a smaller version of the machine."
// AcceptString :
"P3390234887" "So I'll go in there, get the tech, and get out."
// SendOffString :
"P792971369" "Exactly. Splice does not need to recreate an entire creature; she just needs enough of the technology to make a small device to amplify Subjugator 5's powers.<br><br>We all believe that, if utilized properly, Subjugator 5 can <color yellow>break Penelope Yin's hold on the Awakened.<color> After that, the Awakened will turn and destroy the Yin's and their reputation here.<br><br>Be careful in the base, {HeroName}. <color yellow>Your presence will be noticed. You'll have about three minutes before Silver Mantis arrives. If you can defeat enough Arachnos in there, however, Splice can send out a fake signal to misdirect Silver Mantis.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3737388356" "Steal Proto Jade Tarantula Technology"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3102172655" "Be on your guard in the base, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2334340683" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Old Projects</color>"

