// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4177096866" "Do you think this project will ever actually take off?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3151857174" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>No idea, but we have to keep working on it."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P212241205" "I don't trust Scirocco. He's different since Dark Astoria."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1316885126" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I heard him mumbling something about some order of winds."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P353154234" "Who's supposed to be in charge of starting up the Jade Spider project?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P315781817" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>No idea. Some people are saying it could be Weaver-1, but I haven't seen him in... well, I've -never- seen him."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3756216427" "Things have changed since Red Widow was revived."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1024112585" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Tell me about it. Feels like Lord Recluse is more focused than ever."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3282285546" "Is Lord Recluse over that whole Project DESTINY?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2484791745" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>From what I've heard? He's got bigger plans ahead. This new stuff eclipses DESTINY."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2591977726" "I saw the strangest thing on a mission the other day. Ice Mistral actually showed -mercy- to a Longbow soldier."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1667458519" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I don't like it. Scirocco's doing something to make her like that."
