"P2134383273" "<em no t=5 d=5>Penny, you can't do this alone! Let me help you!"
// 6 Actor1 :
"P2395772134" "NO! You've done enough for me... father... I can do this... I can save the Awakened!"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P2644686443" "<em point t=5 d=5>You CAN'T! Penny, I am your FATHER! STOP!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3306362228" "If I let go... they'll go wild... they'll kill each other... I can contain their anger!"
// 3 Actor2 :
"P1376448570" "<em frustrated t=3 d=3>No! PENNY!"
// 0 Actor1 :
"P3852890912" "AAAAAAAAAAGGGHHH!!!"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P776594922" "<t=5 d=5>Penny?"
// 0 Actor1 :
"P4053422855" "<f=actor2>"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P616704314" "<t=5 d=5>Speak to me, Penny!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3359533109" "... Your Penelope Yin is gone."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3791441866" "We are the embodiment of all the hatred... all the anger... all of the pain from the Awakened."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1377925795" "You may call us... Penelope Mayhem. And now, it's time for you to die, old man."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3250129143" "This isn't over... I WILL Get my Penny back!"
// 5 Actor1 :
"P2167342134" "There is much hatred in us that must be spread... spread to the whole world!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_2_NAME :
"P2100324679" "Wu Yin"
// Script Variable ACTOR_3_NAME :
"P534853849" "NAME"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P337629768" "Give me a hand here, {HeroName}, she won't go quietly!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3731237859" "Alright {HeroName}, we can clean this up if we kill Washington!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - CutsceneFinished 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2648041513" "Something... unexpected happened."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3322122103" "{HeroName}... I must say, I didn't expect that to happen, very unexpected. Penelope Yin has gone off the literal deep end. Subjugator 5 has been scanning her mind since the incident. She has full control over the Awakened, still. Ah... no, I believe that's the wrong word for it. She <i>is</i> the Awakened now. Not to fear, however.<br><br>It would appear <i>you</i> have a very strong image in this Penelope Mayhem's mind, according to Subjugator 5. She says that Penelope Mayhem sees you as a sort of creator, a god of sorts. You were the one in her mind before the trigger happened. In fact, you were the one who caused the trigger in the first place!<br><br>I would have thought that Penelope Yin would back away once she lost control, yes, back away to save herself. Instead, she chose to do the heroic option to try to sacrifice herself, and look at what it did for her.<br><br>I think our work is done here with the Awakened... now, we just have ourselves some fun."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PenelopeMayhem 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1815838359" "How could I forget you, {HeroName}? You are the Creator of hatred, the one who united the Awakened in us.<br><br>Everything is owed to you, <i>everything</i>. Without you, the hatred would be shattered, broken, <i>controlled</i>.<br><br>You even aided in the defeat of the Other Yin and the annoying Spirit girl. The power of our hatred is weakened, however, from their assault.<br><br>We must retreat to repower ourselves."
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P14369189" "How could I forget you, {HeroName}? You are the Creator of hatred, the one who united the Awakened in us."
// Answer Text :
"P3497802799" "Get out of here, we'll see each other again."
// Answer Text :
"P829308648" "I'm not your Creator, Penelope."
// Answer Text :
"P1975009102" "What can you do to help me in the future?"
// Page NotCreator Text :
"P2560594138" "Why would you say that? You are our Creator! There is no other way to describe you. We saw you fight the former vessel, we saw you defeat her in her mind.<br><br>You were the catalyst that brought us all together.<br><br>We owe you everything, and there is no way for you to change our minds on the matter."
// Page NotCreator SayOutLoudText :
"P1887242021" "You were the catalyst that brought us all together."
// Answer Text :
"P3701081363" "Alright, you should get out of here."
// Page HelpMeToHelpYou Text :
"P3566551056" "We will do our best to watch over you, {HeroName}. You are precious to us and your life is valued more than any of those in Paragon or the Isles.<br><br>we have our own goals, of course... but we shall aid you should you be in danger or in need of more support. You have our word on that."
// Page HelpMeToHelpYou SayOutLoudText :
"P2398631864" "We shall aid you should you be in danger or in need of more support. You have our word on that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3708626212" "It appears that Penelope Mayhem is causing chaos in Faultline as we speak. She's fighting her counterpart, <color yellow>Penelope Yin</color>, while also yelling various things about <i>you</i>, {HeroName}. All good, of course, but nonetheless, your presence is known.<br><br>If I may be so bold, I suggest you make an appearance in Faultline to bear witness to your work. You could even, oh, I don't know, cause some chaos alongside Miss Mayhem and give one last final show to the people of Paragon. It would be taking advantage of the situation that you have personally created."
// AcceptString :
"P2035439966" "I'll need a way in to Faultline, Mr. G."
// SendOffString :
"P2565932773" "I can arrange one for you. Unfortunately, our Vanguard helicopter has ceased to work. I believe Gaussian was able to hack remotely into the computer and disable all of the devices. Splice did her best to stop him, but in the end she was bested.<br><br>We can get you in through a series of sewer systems, however. At that point, it will be up to you to cause some chaos in the area and leave your mark on Faultline.<br><br>The rest of us shall be here waiting to hear the news of your acts, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1699767299" "Cause Chaos in Faultline"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P729258367" "Faultline hasn't had a terrible amount of villainous attention lately. Let's change that."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1915164159" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Cracking Faultline</color>"

